# Use Cases

| # | Use case | Persona | Scenario | Question types | Sample docs | What it tests |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 01 | Due diligence financial review | PE / corp dev analyst reviewing a target | Verify financials, spot red flags, cross-check numbers between annual report, proxy, and Excel model | Numerical calc; cross-doc (10-K vs proxy); Excel step-by-step logic; reasoning on covenants/warning signs | Microsoft FY24 10-K + proxy; Volvo annual 2024; Maersk annual 2024; SVB last 10-Q; synthesized Excel model deck with planted logic errors | Numeric extraction + cross-doc consistency + chained reasoning |
| 02 | ESG / sustainability audit | Sustainability lead prepping CSRD, or auditor | Extract every Scope 3 category, every material topic, every emissions figure; verify against CSRD/ESRS | Exhaustive search; numerical aggregation; multi-doc cross-reference (report vs framework) | Unilever / Ørsted / H&M sustainability reports 2024; CSRD ESRS standards | Long-doc exhaustive extraction + framework alignment |
| 03 | Regulatory-vs-policy gap check | GRC / internal audit | Enumerate every obligation in a regulation; assess if internal policy addresses each yes/partial/no with citations on both sides | Cross-doc (reg vs policy); exhaustive requirements enumeration; classification; reasoning on partial coverage | EU AI Act consolidated; GDPR; NIS2; repo's `ops_security.docx` + `secure_dev_policy.docx`; synthesized policy with planted gaps | Cross-doc reasoning + exhaustiveness + citation fidelity |
| 04 | Contract clause sweep | Legal ops / M&A counsel | Across a bundle of contracts, find every change-of-control, LoL, IP assignment, termination-for-convenience clause; classify each | Exhaustive (find every X); classification; clause-level citation fidelity | 5–10 SEC EDGAR public material contracts; synthesized MSA bundle with planted clauses | Exhaustive search across many docs + accurate clause-level citation |
| 05 | Board / committee composition audit | Corporate secretariat | Identify every board member + committee assignment; reconcile across proxy, governance HTML, scanned meeting minutes | Exhaustive person extraction; cross-doc identity resolution; mixed formats | 3 cos' DEF 14A proxy statements; frozen governance HTML; board photo / org-chart PDF; handwritten meeting-minutes scan | Exhaustive person extraction + identity reconciliation across formats |
| 06 | Multimodal evidence extraction | Advisory / forensic analyst | Pull facts from scanned old report, whiteboard photo, Excel with chart-as-image, handwritten notes | OCR-grade text from scans; handwriting recognition; image-only chart interpretation; cross-modal reconciliation | Scanned 1990s annual report; whiteboard photo; multi-tab Excel with chart-as-image; original handwritten analyst notes | Format coverage — exposes tools that can't ingest non-text inputs |
